{"time": 1774170216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494609579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "许司昤大致听见警员对安德鲁斯提到了书店、礼拜堂和头骨，而椎名绪则清楚地听见警员说的是，书店内并未找到头骨，沉思礼拜堂地下的那两具骸骨的头骨部分则散落在骸骨的周围"}
{"time": 1774170276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067480597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "并且鉴于并没有正式的搜查证，警员只是进入了书店大致查看便离开了"}
{"time": 1774170318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "83089033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "安德鲁斯坐回审讯案前“我们并没有找到你们说的什么头骨。”"}
{"time": 1774170382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998355916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（难道我们被跟踪了"}
{"time": 1774170399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095871356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=334358605]安德鲁斯显然并不想认同这种超自然的解释，但也无法反驳托马斯越狱的奇怪特性"}
{"time": 1774170531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920066453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1636606829][CQ:at,qq=3362422751] “关于这个里希特的死亡，床上有挣扎的痕迹吗？还是说被一击毙命？”"}
{"time": 1774170553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906287254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（感觉那个头骨他们拿去用）"}
{"time": 1774170557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004918983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（了）"}
{"time": 1774170581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693358800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（献祭是吧jpg）"}
{"time": 1774170593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107636148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“所以你们的意思是，一个无业游民，两个大学生和一个报社撰稿人，就因为调查房东的心脏病突发死亡，一路跑来查了十几年前的沉思礼拜堂案件，又牵扯到各次儿童失踪案，最后引出了一位可敬的退伍警官的死亡？”安德鲁斯有些面色难看"}
{"time": 1774170636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117800857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“是”"}
{"time": 1774170641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657204148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=920066453]“没有挣扎的痕迹，应该是睡梦之中被人偷袭毙命……但以里希特先生的警觉程度……”"}
{"time": 1774170701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222300890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“噩梦一直在侵扰我们，而神在睡梦中告诉我这和这些事件有关”"}
{"time": 1774170725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079886327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "安德鲁斯面无表情地盯着哈里和苏立绘"}
{"time": 1774170738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088430018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“呵呵。”"}
{"time": 1774170866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017365460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“我们也没想到会发生那么多事情，”回答他，“最开始我们确实只是想调查诺特先生的死，现在这个局面对大家来说都有些不可收拾了吧，而你也知道，我们几个只是手无寸铁之民，绝对没做过伤天害理之事。”"}
{"time": 1774170870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106254364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=A3387CD48B9EE9746EFD37ADC326D2DB.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSMzKpBPnpxzAHbBrGPlC_Stj40GxiIowEg_woohJPLw5WzkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQcOlJDi92zRRgC14NzrAA-noCMyOCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMIECjAbXO8GOPeDSqxiYEv0b25jFHzNY_-hkvVaRjlQWzxKNkKthpVegS2sXBQYejw,file_size=20872]"}
{"time": 1774170910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430812544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“而至于你，哈里，无业游民？恐怕不是吧？经过询问，居民们报告你频繁出入过一些黑色地带……你为什么会和他们几个人混到一起？”"}
{"time": 1774170930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291783788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1017365460]（困难说服）"}
{"time": 1774170937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101059105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "。ra困难说服"}
{"time": 1774170937, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2101059105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[椎名绪]进行技能[说服(困难):20(40)]检定: 1D100=49/20 失败，人面不知何处去，桃花依旧笑春风"}
{"time": 1774170943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937388110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（😞）"}
{"time": 1774170954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482627436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“诺顿先生给我们的信在我的书包里，你们可以查看一下，他刚开始只是拜托我们调查关于托马斯的事情，后面我们发现有人冒充他写信给我们，我们开始追查诺顿先生死亡的事情，经过调查，我们又追溯到了孩子失踪和托马斯的事情”"}
{"time": 1774171044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741822306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1017365460]安德鲁斯不为所动“手无寸铁只是你自己的说辞。或许你们并非杀死里希特先生的犯人，但暂且我们无法去除你们和此案凶手关联的嫌疑”"}
{"time": 1774171090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331273125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=482627436]“你不觉得中间省略的有点多了吗？”安德鲁斯敲了敲桌子"}
{"time": 1774171240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907913400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=430812544][CQ:at,qq=3362422751] “黑色地带？我不知道你说的是什么。至于我为什么要帮助他们，许的姐姐帮过我大忙，为了还他们一个人情罢了”"}
{"time": 1774171369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703202050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "安德鲁斯笑了笑，显然没有完全相信，但也并没有就此处和你多加辩驳"}
