{"time": 1775977373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805614904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1393941015]“除了被他们胁迫参加任务之外，我已经很少跟他们接触了，我一直在独自研究…现在我已经研究出了各自回到原来身体的仪式！但是一样需要那个仪式球体！”"}
{"time": 1775977395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333597288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（不给不给jpg）"}
{"time": 1775977416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812610182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“我们肯定先办正事啊”"}
{"time": 1775977427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771686785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（谁理你）"}
{"time": 1775977462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323399781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1697202568]“之前应该有，在他家的照片，我看见他原本不长卷宗上的样子”"}
{"time": 1775977464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210188214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1697202568]玛丽古怪地看着你们，“他偶尔还在尝试没有仪式球体的时候进行试验性仪式，还有就是用来让你们做噩梦和一定程度上监视你们的仪式…”"}
{"time": 1775977485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897287692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1805614904]“我能明白。”微笑着说，“我们现在也有自己要做的事情，我相信你也不会觉得我们是坏人，况且你需要的东西也还在我们这，我们互相帮助不好吗？”"}
{"time": 1775977504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123038270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=210188214][CQ:at,qq=3362422751] “有成功吗？”"}
{"time": 1775977568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769483469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1697202568]“之后没有球了，应该就没有再成功过，不然至于这么激进入室杀人”"}
{"time": 1775977656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117900628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=393327177]玛丽固执并表现出有些害怕般地猛烈摇头，“不，如果不帮我先换回身体，我是不会再给予你们额外帮助的，你们以为没有我回到原来身体后的帮助你们就能战胜托马斯吗？！”"}
{"time": 1775977708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "666451185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“你那身体能干啥呀？躺在那不动多久了”"}
{"time": 1775977742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1183490166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（kp如此强硬，不会是真的要换回来才行吧jpg）"}
{"time": 1775977762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135483493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=71B1699A0C1B9FF5457BB45906AC4CEF.png,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQRol4g-lHMtJeyvZKI9038XIthKxjrTSD_Cij5yqXd4OeTAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhBLUSWHWZVZnLH_QO3HUm01egLtN4IBAmd6&amp;rkey=CAQSMLWHwXgQJ-mpSkMPyZwy-KlqF8S0jAKQGXJ_2T7bgsF49cxeFJnJ_bQAQ6XcWRsbvg,file_size=9963]"}
{"time": 1775977829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1086903189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（没事，先顺着他说等仪式的时候再破坏地球仪，这样应该是用过它换意识的人有可能会受到伤害吧）"}
{"time": 1775977931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1289323300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1897287692]玛丽冷漠地看着你们“我已经提供了非常多信息，而我根本看不到你们的诚意！如果还想要我的帮助的话，就带上我原来的身体和我一起去葡萄岛，否则我不会再提供任何额外帮助！”"}
{"time": 1775978035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508479000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（我的法克呀扛着那么大的身体出去不被抓才怪）"}
{"time": 1775978092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253248145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1117900628]“哎呀姐姐你别着急嘛，我们帮你帮你，你说得教我们怎么用嘛，现在是你需求更大吧，你的身体你自己想办法弄出来，我们可以帮你推着 抱着，但是要怎么弄出来你自己想办法，我们只想省事些”"}
{"time": 1775978115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415614320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“我可不想再招惹那些条子”"}
{"time": 1775978193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047248250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“如果你没办法把身体弄出来，那我们只好先行上岛了，等我们回你想到办法把你的身体弄出来了，我们再帮你也不迟”"}
{"time": 1775978310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505939769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1289323300][CQ:at,qq=3362422751] “不要着急，我要先确认你可以信任才会给你提供帮助”"}
{"time": 1775978438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1514687122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“当初托马是如何向你们解释仪式的？”"}
{"time": 1775978588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128479327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=666451185]（肌肉都萎缩了吧，我怀疑她是想要我们的身体？我们不会有人被撕卡吧）"}
{"time": 1775978629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128530228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=253248145]“只要你们找个晚上立即带走我的身体去到葡萄岛，条子怎么找得到你们？待我换回原来身体再解决那个仪式室之后，条子怎么还会为难你们？”"}
{"time": 1775978706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707409835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“本来这个精神病院就大部分都是重症患者没有什么安保力量，找个晚上带走我的身体，条子发现怎么也要第二天早上了，那时我们怎么都到葡萄岛了！”"}
{"time": 1775978789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96108720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“我们呀身手不太好，你想个办法不让人察觉带我们进去又带我们出去吧，我们自己行动，保不齐身体弄不出来，我们人还被扣那儿了，有你在就算我们被抓住了，有你亲戚的身份也好辩解些”"}
{"time": 1775978926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940031767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=505939769]“呵呵，我只看到了你们白白听着我给的情报还想着我的帮助，你以为我就信任你们？如果不是该死的托马斯不值得信任我怎么还会来找你们？”"}
{"time": 1775978962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077449643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1514687122]“你觉得他会对他盲目的信徒们详细解释仪式原理吗？”"}
{"time": 1775979002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246287705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=96108720]“那就今晚，你们挑两个人我们深夜进来，带着身体立即就去葡萄岛！”"}
{"time": 1775979021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2135813491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“那他总要告诉你们仪式的作用吧”"}
{"time": 1775979078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1714769322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1246287705]“好，其他两个人在门口等”"}
{"time": 1775979089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1915387672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（谁上？）"}
