{"time": 1776587744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063457591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "玛丽带着你们前往港口的角落“这边有我们的船”"}
{"time": 1776587827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437424092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2007972984]“当然要划桨啊，不然怎么过去”"}
{"time": 1776587932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85143350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "四处观察一下有没有人跟着，然后把玛丽安置在船上"}
{"time": 1776587956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598672619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "我也踏上船，“三位女士需要帮忙吗？”"}
{"time": 1776588036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882759821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "*踏上船"}
{"time": 1776588037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322196443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=85143350]周围并没有你们之外的其他人，并且你注意到玛丽的身体已经睁开了眼睛，不过看起来除了有些失焦的眼睛外并没有任何其他动静"}
{"time": 1776588063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146936763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*上船"}
{"time": 1776588236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520546512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "找到浆，向葡萄岛划去"}
{"time": 1776588238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584615374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "那么你们一行六人都已上了小船"}
{"time": 1776588277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547546748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“靠岸有没有什么学问来着？哪里的守卫力量比较小”"}
{"time": 1776588354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016619412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1520546512]当你们向葡萄岛驶去时，水面逐渐泛起薄雾，而越靠近葡萄岛这雾便愈是浓烈，此外你们能看见大概三座小岛"}
{"time": 1776588364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583337469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“向中间那座划就行”"}
{"time": 1776588385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "41160599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1547546748]“没有守卫力量，跟着我走就行”"}
{"time": 1776588427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772929221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“但还是要注意小心，岛上有些…游荡着的东西”"}
{"time": 1776588450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436253795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“好的”"}
{"time": 1776588467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588153676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“啥东西？”"}
{"time": 1776588499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870193579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“好的，武器这不就派上用场了嘛。”我说"}
{"time": 1776588517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007392904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（你不能休息 周围有怪物在游荡）"}
{"time": 1776588519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552799829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（zombie）"}
{"time": 1776588554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405841591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“先前他们实验的失败品，虽然大部分被我们控制起来了，但还有一只逃出来并在岛上游荡”"}
{"time": 1776588596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535439211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“事实上我还有一个问题啊”"}
{"time": 1776588622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101358461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1776588643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736928358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“为什么我们要在岛上举行交换身体的仪式呢？”"}
{"time": 1776588646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119058888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“这样不是更加容易被发现吗？”"}
{"time": 1776588666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1324312592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“对呀，我也想问”"}
{"time": 1776588680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514917291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（仪式对地方用具都有要求吧）"}
{"time": 1776588697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361681049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“沉思礼拜堂应该也可以举行仪式吧”"}
{"time": 1776588708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020776060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“毕竟你们之前就在哪里举行过仪式”"}
{"time": 1776588786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534631733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（那附近有警察，之前那房间也已经毁了）"}
{"time": 1776588859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062952603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=361681049]“以前可以，现在不行了，所有仪式辅助用的东西都被警方摧毁或者拿走了”"}
{"time": 1776588887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109798632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“现在只能在仪式室里这个仪式球体才能发挥作用”"}
{"time": 1776588953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828363372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“欸，原来不止需要那个地球仪啊”"}
{"time": 1776589005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779249855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“那当然”"}
{"time": 1776589020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120621985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“好麻烦呀，万一我们失败了咋整？”"}
{"time": 1776589118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367004843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“什么失败，仪式球体都在手上，只要能不惊扰岛上的人，还能怎样失败吗”"}
{"time": 1776589135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636915449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“不是呀，我的意思是没有换回来”"}
{"time": 1776589147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "306799420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“那更不可能。”"}
{"time": 1776589272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767248459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“这仪式我花了这么多年研究完善，只是换回原来身体罢了，而且，就算失败了，对你们也没有什么影响吧。”"}
{"time": 1776589351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905036384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“葡萄岛就要到了，还有什么要问的吗？”"}
{"time": 1776589364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590562169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“上岸之后就该小心了。”"}
{"time": 1776589380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023673762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*看向其他人"}
{"time": 1776589412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701163143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“我没别的想问的了，我已经准备好了”"}
{"time": 1776589423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729546299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（刚才去煮了个面回来刚刚好jpg）"}
{"time": 1776589476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720023030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“我也没别的想问的了”"}
{"time": 1776589687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074475908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "那么在沉默静谧的雾中，你们终于到了一座破旧的小码头，码头上还系着其他的船只"}
{"time": 1776589708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117094657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "上了海岸线之后，周围浓重的雾气便立即消失了"}
{"time": 1776589735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983737115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（我去洗个澡，默认我跟随）"}
