{"time": 1777208469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500550320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“大概还是没问题的。”拉着哈里的手试图让自己站起来，“谢谢。”"}
{"time": 1777208549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353164542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "玛丽看了看椎名绪和倒地的怪物，有些后怕，又稍做思考，“既然实验体已经死了，我们可以加快点速度…得抓住现在他们还没睡醒的机会…”"}
{"time": 1777208618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587240582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "背起大玛丽，继续向前"}
{"time": 1777208678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583356993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*跟随"}
{"time": 1777208698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63285420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "*跟随"}
{"time": 1777208702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312112027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "*跟随"}
{"time": 1777208781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335092937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "那么你们紧紧地跟上小玛丽，一会便注意到了那座矗立于黑暗之中的小型单层房屋"}
{"time": 1777208877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138692841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“那里是干嘛的”*压低声音"}
{"time": 1777208958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919521281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=138692841]玛丽在黑暗中向你回头，你没看清她的眼神，但大概是对你作了个白眼“当然是他们的基地啊，尤其是用来进行那些你们不会陌生的仪式”"}
{"time": 1777209014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799876669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（咋这么对救命恩人说话的）"}
{"time": 1777209016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1027384744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=0A46E70CB1E4F84EB03F27C1D1D10E55.png,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRkg_hud9PexEXBKn9Enbd7Y87alRiSHCD_Cijqj-7Ay4uUAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhA7dPaYBAo7kGIXPxriIoNgegKCEYIBAmd6&amp;rkey=CAMSMFf3LtkIcTDCUYz5HZIPu_Iq31K3WqpUPiGWWdpzrrxSMb2xWI2tbFNTwaTKFpWDKA,file_size=3602]"}
{"time": 1777209071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685242822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“等会我们会进入地下室，注意千万别打开地下室里的栏门，那里面有四只被托马斯关起来的畸形融合体，除非你们想被一瞬间撕成碎片”"}
{"time": 1777209109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551989430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“并且到时候注意保护好地球仪，在地下室内它会非常脆弱。”"}
{"time": 1777209116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319632278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "“明白”"}
{"time": 1777209118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "850707015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“这些试验品会攻击他们自己人吗”"}
{"time": 1777209129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065856918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（一会一下打碎它）"}
{"time": 1777209204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387479629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=850707015]你看到玛丽的头微微顿住，似乎忍住了回头向你继续翻白眼的冲动“那你以为我们在岛上为什么要躲着那只刚刚还在攻击我们的怪物？”"}
{"time": 1777209260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100872567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2065856918]（厉害）"}
{"time": 1777209286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131117377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（小心我一个手滑"}
{"time": 1777209453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095026077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "玛丽又说“准确的说，是进行完仪式的地球仪会很脆弱，所以我们的计划是，在我换回原来身体之后，破坏掉地下室的仪式结构，并带走仪式球体寻找其他这样富有能量之地，到时候就可以慢慢给其他精神病院里的受害者换回身体。”"}
{"time": 1777209503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659774658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“除非你们不想救回那些受害者了，否则最好保护好地球仪。”"}
{"time": 1777209532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070998374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“当然最后我们也要悄悄离开，以免提前被托马斯追杀”"}
{"time": 1777209584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437923828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“那么，后面如何突袭托马斯呢？”"}
{"time": 1777209616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651885103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“？突袭托马斯？”"}
{"time": 1777209630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106081966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“想自杀的话我不拦你”"}
{"time": 1777209638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448167218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“。。。”"}
{"time": 1777209649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518635506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“但不要搭上我和其他人”"}
{"time": 1777209652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168396711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“还是个毒舌”"}
{"time": 1777209655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54204360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "一一"}, "message": "（我感觉她想和我们换，别听她的，她要一个久卧退化的身体干嘛？）"}
{"time": 1777209660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757761690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“咱们此行的目的不是捉拿托马斯归案吗？”"}
{"time": 1777209671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623510852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（我听听她的说辞）"}
{"time": 1777209688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169658855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“不然其他受害者怎么样解放”"}
{"time": 1777209703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011936986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“我们的噩梦又怎么样结束呢？”"}
{"time": 1777209898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111302564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1757761690]“？”玛丽猛地转过身，看起来已经有怒火升腾，但还是尽力维持住冷静“我在精神病院已经说得很清楚了，帮我换回身体，我帮你们找到托马斯据点并绕开防御，最后破坏掉仪式室以后他们自然没法对你们进行之后的仪式，那该死的噩梦也就从你们脑子里滚出去了，到底该死的有哪里没说明白？”"}
{"time": 1777209944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "880930597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（oh不行孩子，这样不够伟大）"}
{"time": 1777209952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000536240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（凶什么凶呀）"}
{"time": 1777209962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839461971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（必须要打死啊jpg）"}
{"time": 1777210007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259964568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“怎么，在我兑现了我的大部分诺言之后又想着临时改口？你们也不想想托马斯那家伙活了多少年了？就他的力量你真以为你们这群家伙可以对抗？”"}
{"time": 1777210069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743305736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "假装思索一下，“好吧，那我们继续吧”"}
{"time": 1777210072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298842864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“打死了一个逃出来的实验体也沾沾自喜上了？要不是托马斯懒得管我们，这样子的家伙他随便就可以抓起来，也不想想地下室里那四只是怎么会被关起来的？”"}
{"time": 1777210088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044696940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“明白了就快点闭嘴安静跟上。”"}
{"time": 1777210122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847333046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "（好的我原本还在犹豫的）"}
{"time": 1777210127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482622456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（有没有打死这个人的选项）"}
